### 2. MODERN ENHANCEMENTS — 18 AAA Upgrades

| # | Enhancement | Three.js Implementation Detail |
|---|-------------|-------------------------------|
| 1 | **Neon Glow Emissives** | `MeshStandardMaterial` with `emissive: neonColor`, `emissiveIntensity: 2.0`; bloom via `UnrealBloomPass(threshold=0.85, strength=1.4, radius=0.4)` |
| 2 | **Procedural Animated Sprites** | Canvas API generates 2-frame flip animation per invader type; texture updated every `animationInterval` ms |
| 3 | **Dynamic Starfield Parallax** | Three depth layers of stars at different Z positions, moving at inverse speed ratios (0.1x, 0.5x, 1.0x) |
| 4 | **Trauma-Based Camera Shake** | `CameraController.shake(intensity, duration)` accumulates shake vectors; decay via `shake *= 0.92` per frame |
| 5 | **Hit-Stop Frame Freeze** | On impact: set `timeScale = 0` for `hitStopFrames × (1/60)`, then resume; particles spawn during freeze |
| 6 | **Particle Burst System** | Object-pooled particles with velocity spread, gravity, fade-out; color based on invader type |
| 7 | **Motion Trails** | `MotionTrails` stores last N positions per fast object; renders as fading ribbon mesh |
| 8 | **Shockwave Rings** | Expanding torus mesh at impact point, scale from 0→max over `shockwaveDuration`, opacity fade-out |
| 9 | **Floating 3D Score Text** | HTML overlay with CSS animations positioned via world-to-screen projection; rises and fades over 1s |
| 10 | **Synthesized Sound Effects** | Web Audio API: oscillators for lasers (sawtooth, pitch sweep), noise buffer for explosions |
| 11 | **Glassmorphic UI Overlay** | CSS `backdrop-filter: blur(12px)`, semi-transparent backgrounds, neon border glows via `box-shadow` |
| 12 | **Progressive Difficulty Scaling** | Grid speed increases linearly with invader count; enemy fire rate scales inversely with remaining invaders |
| 13 | **Invader "Squash" Animation** | On hit: scale Y by 0.7, X by 1.3 for brief moment before destruction VFX |
| 14 | **Player Shield Visualizer** | Rotating energy ring around player ship when shield active; color indicates remaining charge |
| 15 | **Danger Floor Lighting** | When enemy bullets near floor: emit red glow from bottom of screen via `PointLight` with decay |
| 16 | **Combo Multiplier Display** | Large centered text showing current combo level; pulses on increment, fades on timeout |
| 17 | **Boss "Mothership" Event** | Every 3rd wave: large boss spawns at top with unique health pool and attack patterns |
| 18 | **Victory Fanfare Sequence** | Camera zooms out, all remaining particles burst simultaneously, score rolls up with music crescendo |

